  "details": "Even from instances they do not have access to. \n\n(Or something equivalent that still give people some privacy)\n\nThe reason why I wish this was a feature is very simple: I make maps, mainly for myself, but I love seeing that others also like what I'm doing.\n\nUnfortunately, for the most part, I have no idea who ends up hosting instances of my maps. So it's a bit hard to get an idea of who uses it, for what, what their wishes could be and what future updates should, or should not include.\n\nIs it used for sleeping? For role play? For hanging out? For 1 on 1s? By large groups? Small groups? Are some people/groups using it regularly?\n\nThings like that.",
